  "notes": "Keyboard: J confirm, K back, W/A/S/D move, U/I/J/K attacks; arrows move the cursor only until the first match. The desktop window is black while UEVR renders, so screens are read from the Mopic display. Quit: Main menu > OPTIONS > the last item (quit game) > yes.",
